{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33911","headline":"秋晚自洞庭湖别业寄穆秀才 · 皮日休","name":"秋晚自洞庭湖别业寄穆秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"破村寥落过重阳，独自撄宁葺草房。\n风撦红蕉仍换叶，雨淋黄菊不成香。\n野猨偷栗重窥户，落雁疑人更绕塘。\n他日若修耆旧传，爲予添取此书堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33911.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33911","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}